# Declares this jar's connectors to the platform.
#
# The registry discovers connectors through ServiceLoader, so nothing in the platform
# references these classes by name. Adding a connector never means editing existing code.
#
# Four relational databases, one implementation — only the SQL that genuinely differs
# (upsert syntax, identifier quoting, streaming semantics) lives in JdbcDialect.
com.dmp.connector.jdbc.Dialects$Postgres
com.dmp.connector.jdbc.Dialects$MySql
com.dmp.connector.jdbc.Dialects$SqlServer
com.dmp.connector.jdbc.Dialects$Oracle
